{"suttaId":"thi-ap30","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[9763,9950],"vripara":"426"},"segments":{"thi-ap30:0.3":"Yasodharāpamukhaaṭṭhārasabhikkhunīsahassaapadānaṃ","thi-ap30:1.1":"“Aṭṭhārasasahassāni, bhikkhunī sakyasambhavā;","thi-ap30:1.3":"Yasodharāpamukhāni, sambuddhaṃ upasaṅkamuṃ.","thi-ap30:2.1":"“Aṭṭhārasasahassāni, sabbā honti mahiddhikā;","thi-ap30:2.3":"Vandantī munino pāde, ārocenti yathābalaṃ.","thi-ap30:3.1":"“‘Jāti khīṇā jarā byādhi, maraṇañca mahāmuni;","thi-ap30:3.3":"Anāsavaṃ padaṃ santaṃ, amataṃ yāma nāyaka.","thi-ap30:4.1":"“‘Khalitañce pure atthi, sabbāsampi mahāmuni;","thi-ap30:4.3":"Aparādhamajānantī, khama amhaṃ vināyaka.","thi-ap30:5.1":"“‘Iddhiñcāpi nidassetha, mama sāsanakārikā;","thi-ap30:5.3":"Parisānañca sabbāsaṃ, kaṅkhaṃ chindatha yāvatā.","thi-ap30:6.1":"“‘Yasodharā mahāvīra, manāpā piyadassanā;","thi-ap30:6.3":"Sabbā tuyhaṃ mahāvīra, agārasmiṃ pajāpati.","thi-ap30:7.1":"“‘Thīnaṃ satasahassānaṃ, navutīnaṃ chaduttari;","thi-ap30:7.3":"Agāre te mayaṃ vīra, pāmokkhā sabbā issarā.","thi-ap30:8.1":"“‘Rūpācāraguṇūpetā, yobbanaṭṭhā piyaṃvadā;","thi-ap30:8.3":"Sabbā no apacāyanti, devatā viya mānusā.","thi-ap30:9.1":"“‘Aṭṭhārasasahassāni, sabbā sākiyasambhavā;","thi-ap30:9.3":"Yasodharāsahassāni, pāmokkhā issarā tadā.","thi-ap30:10.1":"“‘Kāmadhātumatikkamma, saṇṭhitā rūpadhātuyā;","thi-ap30:10.3":"Rūpena sadisā natthi, sahassānaṃ mahāmuni.","thi-ap30:11.1":"“‘Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, iddhiṃ dassaṃsu satthuno;","thi-ap30:11.3":"Nekā nānāvidhākārā, mahāiddhīpi dassayuṃ.","thi-ap30:12.1":"“‘Cakkavāḷasamaṃ kāyaṃ, sīsaṃ uttarato kuru;","thi-ap30:12.3":"Ubho pakkhā duve dīpā, jambudīpaṃ sarīrato.","thi-ap30:13.1":"“‘Dakkhiṇañca saraṃ piñchaṃ, nānāsākhā tu pattakā;","thi-ap30:13.3":"Candañca sūriyañcakkhi, merupabbatato sikhaṃ.","thi-ap30:14.1":"“‘Cakkavāḷagiriṃ tuṇḍaṃ, jamburukkhaṃ samūlakaṃ;","thi-ap30:14.3":"Bījamānā upāgantvā, vandantī lokanāyakaṃ.","thi-ap30:15.1":"“‘Hatthivaṇṇaṃ tathevassaṃ, pabbataṃ jaladhiṃ tathā;","thi-ap30:15.3":"Candañca sūriyaṃ meruṃ, sakkavaṇṇañca dassayuṃ.","thi-ap30:16.1":"“‘Yasodharā mayaṃ vīra, pāde vandāma cakkhuma;","thi-ap30:16.3":"Tava cirapabhāvena, nipphannā naranāyaka.","thi-ap30:17.1":"“‘Iddhīsu ca vasī homa, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap30:17.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homa mahāmune.","thi-ap30:18.1":"“‘Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāma, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap30:18.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap30:19.1":"“‘Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap30:19.3":"Ñāṇaṃ amhaṃ mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap30:20.1":"“‘Pubbānaṃ lokanāthānaṃ, saṅgamaṃ no nidassitaṃ;","thi-ap30:20.3":"Adhikārā bahū amhaṃ, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap30:21.1":"“‘Yaṃ amhaṃ pūritaṃ kammaṃ, kusalaṃ sarase mune;","thi-ap30:21.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, puññānupacitāni no.","thi-ap30:22.1":"“‘Abhabbaṭṭhāne vajjetvā, vārayimha anācaraṃ;","thi-ap30:22.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, cattāni jīvitāni no [sañcattaṃ jīvitampi no (syā.)].","thi-ap30:23.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, bhariyatthāyadāsi no;","thi-ap30:23.3":"Na tattha vimanā homa, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap30:24.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, upakārāyadāsi no;","thi-ap30:24.3":"Na tattha vimanā homa, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap30:25.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, bhojanatthāyadāsi no;","thi-ap30:25.3":"Na tattha vimanā homa, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap30:26.1":"“‘Nekakoṭisahassāni, jīvitāni cajimhase [cajimha no (pī. ka.)];","thi-ap30:26.3":"Bhayamokkhaṃ karissāma, jīvitāni cajimhase.","thi-ap30:27.1":"“‘Aṅgagate alaṅkāre, vatthe nānāvidhe bahū;","thi-ap30:27.3":"Itthibhaṇḍe na gūhāma, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap30:28.1":"“‘Dhanadhaññapariccāgaṃ, gāmāni nigamāni ca;","thi-ap30:28.3":"Khettaṃ puttā ca dhītā ca, pariccattā mahāmune.","thi-ap30:29.1":"“‘Hatthī assā gavā cāpi, dāsiyo paricārikā;","thi-ap30:29.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, pariccattaṃ asaṅkhiyaṃ.","thi-ap30:30.1":"“‘Yaṃ amhe paṭimantesi, dānaṃ dassāma yācake;","thi-ap30:30.3":"Vimanaṃ no na passāma, dadato dānamuttamaṃ.","thi-ap30:31.1":"“‘Nānāvidhaṃ bahuṃ dukkhaṃ, saṃsāre ca bahubbidhe;","thi-ap30:31.3":"Tuyhatthāya mahāvīra, anubhuttaṃ asaṅkhiyaṃ.","thi-ap30:32.1":"“‘Sukhappattānumodāma, na ca dukkhesu dummanā;","thi-ap30:32.3":"Sabbattha tulitā homa, tuyhatthāya mahāmune.","thi-ap30:33.1":"“‘Anumaggena sambuddho, yaṃ dhammaṃ abhinīhari;","thi-ap30:33.3":"Anubhotvā sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ, patto bodhiṃ mahāmune.","thi-ap30:34.1":"“‘Brahmadevañca sambuddhaṃ, gotamaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap30:34.3":"Aññesaṃ lokanāthānaṃ, saṅgamaṃ tehi no bahū.","thi-ap30:35.1":"“‘Adhikāraṃ bahuṃ amhe, tuyhatthāya mahāmune;","thi-ap30:35.3":"Gavesato buddhadhamme, mayaṃ te paricārikā.","thi-ap30:36.1":"“‘Kappe ca satasahasse, caturo ca asaṅkhiye;","thi-ap30:36.3":"Dīpaṅkaro mahāvīro, uppajji lokanāyako.","thi-ap30:37.1":"“‘Paccantadesavisaye, nimantetvā tathāgataṃ;","thi-ap30:37.3":"Tassa āgamanaṃ maggaṃ, sodhenti tuṭṭhamānasā.","thi-ap30:38.1":"“‘Tena kālena so āsi, sumedho nāma brāhmaṇo;","thi-ap30:38.3":"Maggañca paṭiyādesi, āyato sabbadassino.","thi-ap30:39.1":"“‘Tena kālena ahumha, sabbā brāhmaṇasambhavā;","thi-ap30:39.3":"Thalūdajāni pupphāni, āharimha samāgamaṃ.","thi-ap30:40.1":"“‘Tasmiṃ so samaye buddho, dīpaṅkaro mahāyaso;","thi-ap30:40.3":"Viyākāsi mahāvīro, isimuggatamānasaṃ.","thi-ap30:41.1":"“‘Calatī ravatī puthavī, saṅkampati sadevake;","thi-ap30:41.3":"Tassa kammaṃ pakittente, isimuggatamānasaṃ.","thi-ap30:42.1":"“‘Devakaññā manussā ca, mayañcāpi sadevakā;","thi-ap30:42.3":"Nānāpūjanīyaṃ bhaṇḍaṃ, pūjayitvāna patthayuṃ.","thi-ap30:43.1":"“‘Tesaṃ buddho viyākāsi, jotidīpa sanāmako;","thi-ap30:43.3":"Ajja ye patthitā atthi, te bhavissanti sammukhā.","thi-ap30:44.1":"“‘Aparimeyye ito kappe, yaṃ no buddho viyākari;","thi-ap30:44.3":"Taṃ vācamanumodentā, evaṃkārī ahumha no.","thi-ap30:45.1":"“‘Tassa kammassa sukatassa, tassa cittaṃ pasādayuṃ;","thi-ap30:45.3":"Devamānusikaṃ yoniṃ, anubhotvā asaṅkhiyaṃ.","thi-ap30:46.1":"“‘Sukhadukkhenubhotvāna, devesu mānusesu ca;","thi-ap30:46.3":"Pacchime bhave sampatte, jātāmha sākiye kule.","thi-ap30:47.1":"“‘Rūpavatī bhogavatī, yasasīlavatī tato;","thi-ap30:47.3":"Sabbaṅgasampadā homa, kulesu abhisakkatā.","thi-ap30:48.1":"“‘Lābhaṃ silokaṃ sakkāraṃ, lokadhammasamāgamaṃ;","thi-ap30:48.3":"Cittañca dukkhitaṃ natthi, vasāma akutobhayā.","thi-ap30:49.1":"“‘Vuttañhetaṃ bhagavatā, rañño antepure tadā;","thi-ap30:49.3":"Khattiyānaṃ pure vīra [tāsaṃ (syā.)], upakārañca niddisi.","thi-ap30:50.1":"“‘Upakārā ca yā nārī, yā ca nārī sukhe dukhe;","thi-ap30:50.3":"Atthakkhāyī ca yā nārī, yā ca nārīnukampikā.","thi-ap30:51.1":"“‘Dhammaṃ care sucaritaṃ, na naṃ duccaritaṃ care;","thi-ap30:51.3":"Dhammacārī sukhaṃ seti, asmiṃ loke paramhi ca.","thi-ap30:52.1":"“‘Agāraṃ vijahitvāna, pabbajimhanagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap30:52.3":"Aḍḍhamāse asampatte, catusaccaṃ phusimha no.","thi-ap30:53.1":"“‘Cīvaraṃ piṇḍapātañca, paccayaṃ sayanāsanaṃ;","thi-ap30:53.3":"Upanenti bahū amhe, sāgarasseva ūmiyo.","thi-ap30:54.1":"“‘Kilesā jhāpitā amhaṃ [mayhaṃ (syā.), amhākaṃ (ka.)], bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","thi-ap30:54.3":"Nāgīva bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāma anāsavā.","thi-ap30:55.1":"“‘Svāgataṃ vata no āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","thi-ap30:55.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap30:56.1":"“‘Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","thi-ap30:56.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ’.","thi-ap30:57.1":"“Evaṃ bahuvidhaṃ dukkhaṃ, sampattī ca bahubbidhā;","thi-ap30:57.3":"Visuddhabhāvaṃ sampattā, labhāma sabbasampadā.","thi-ap30:58.1":"“Yā dadanti sakattānaṃ, puññatthāya mahesino;","thi-ap30:58.3":"Sahāyasampadā honti, nibbānapadamasaṅkhataṃ.","thi-ap30:59.1":"“Parikkhīṇaṃ atītañca, paccuppannaṃ anāgataṃ;","thi-ap30:59.3":"Sabbakammampi no khīṇaṃ, pāde vandāma cakkhuma.","thi-ap30:60.1":"“Nibbānāya vadantīnaṃ, kiṃ vo vakkhāma uttari;","thi-ap30:60.3":"Santasaṅkhatadosañhi, pappotha [santasaṅkhatadoso yo, pajjotaṃ (syā. pī. ka.)] amataṃ padaṃ”.","thi-ap30:61.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ yasodharāpamukhāni aṭṭhārasabhikkhunīsahassāni bhagavato sammukhā imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap30:62.1":"Yasodharāpamukhaaṭṭhārasabhikkhunīsahassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","thi-ap30:63.1":"Kuṇḍalakesīvaggo tatiyo.","thi-ap30:64.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","thi-ap30:65.1":"Kuṇḍalā gotamī ceva, dhammadinnā ca sakulā;","thi-ap30:65.3":"Varanandā ca soṇā ca, kāpilānī yasodharā.","thi-ap30:66.1":"Dasasahassabhikkhunī, aṭṭhārasasahassakā;","thi-ap30:66.3":"Gāthāsatāni cattāri, cha ca sattatimeva ca [aṭṭhasattatimeva ca (syā.)]."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
